    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present this unique, hugely impressive 5 / 6 bedroom split level residence with linked garage on wonderful mature grounds extending to approximately 0.9 acre / 0.36 hectare. Behind the attractive facade is a bright, light filled and cleverly designed interior with well - proportioned rooms arranged to give you optimum accommodation and lots of admiration and delightful features adding to the overall impression. This is indeed a unique family home set amid high trees and tumbling greenery and well maintained lawns providing a fabulous back drop to this special home. It enjoys a convenient location between the village of Clane and Prosperous where all amenities / services that are required for modern family living are readily available. \n\nProsperous is a wonderful village setting with a superb sense of community spirit and support. It offers excellent schools (primary and secondary), pubs, cafes, restaurants, church, doctors surgery, pharmacy and a host of recreational facilities including a superb community playground and park, GAA, soccer, tennis, pitch and putt course and an award winning drama society.The proximity to and availability of all these facilities and more on your doorstep will entice purchasers searching for a quality family home in a convenient location. Commuters will appreciate the frequent daily bus service to Dublin city and easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways combined with convenience to rail links at nearby Sallins and Maynooth.Do not miss this opportunity to acquire a wonderful home in a super setting.\nViewing is highly recommended by appointment.\n\n."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.34m x 1.47m\nWith marble flooring, stone archway, vaulted ceiling, panic button, alarm keypad and cloak room.\n\nLounge - 5.72m x 4.98m\nWith feature cast iron fireplace, walnut flooring, coved ceiling, recessed lighting, t.v. point and French doors rear.\n\nDining Room - 5.8m x 3.58m\nWith solid fuel stove, marble flooring, recessed lighting, corner window and closet.\n\nKitchen - 6.22m x 4.42m\nWith shaker style white kitchen, granite countertop, electric cooker, electric oven, microwave, island/breakfast bar, marble floor, tiled splashback, recessed lighting, glass panel doors to lounge, sliding patio doors to rear.\n\nUtility Room - 2.29m x 1.88m\nWith provision for usual appliances, tiled flooring, painted kitchen units.\n\nGuest WC - 1.85m x 1.24m\nWith tiled floor, tiled splash back, w.c., w.h.b. and recessed lighting.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.01m x 2.92m\nWith feature French pine flooring.\n\nLanding - 5.28m x 1.02m\nWith carpet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 2.95m\nWith mirror front slide robes and feature wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m x 2.95m\nWith laminate flooring and velux roof windows.\n\nLanding - 2.13m x 1.7m\nWith carpet, gallery overlooking the entrance hall.\n\nRear Lobby - 2.62m x 1.27m\nWith tiled flooring and access to car port.\n\nBedroom 4 - 5.49m x 4.06m\nWith feature French pine flooring, wall panelling, t.v. point, telephone point, alarm keypad, panic button and sliding patio doors to balcony.\n\nWalk In Wardrobes - \nWith laminate flooring.\n\nEn-Suite - 3.3m x 3.02m\nFully tiled with antique style bath, enclosed shower cubicle, w.c., w.h.b. and bidet.\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.38m x 2.97m\nWith mirror front slide robes, semi - solid maple flooring.\n\nBedroom 6 - 5.23m x 2.95m\nWith slide robes and semi - solid maple flooring.\n\nCorridor - 5.16m x .99m\nWith semi - solid maple flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.8m x 1.78m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil Fired central heating</li><li>Constructed c.1983</li><li>Approximately 250 sq.m. / 2,691 sq.ft.</li><li>Alarm (requires servicing)</li><li>Double glazed windows, Extensive Wooden flooring</li><li>Pine four panel internal doors</li><li>Lovely fresh décor, Wooded grove to front</li><li>Delightful landscaped grounds with a variety of trees and shrubs, Patio area</li><li>Primary & secondary schools at Prosperous and Clane.</li><li>Frequent bus service to the city, Arrow rail link from Sallins.</li><li>Easy access to both the M4 & M7 motorway.</li><li>Wide range of sporting and recreational facilities available in close proximity.</li><li>Included carpets, curtains, blinds and light fittings</li><li>Services: Mains water and septic tank.</ul>"
      },
